==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44_2EdgeSegments.svg|32px]] '''Silk ControlGrid44_2EdgeSegments''' command creates a ControlGrid44 from a CubicSurface_44 and two CubicCurve_4 segments.

</translate>
