<translate>

{{Caption|A rectangular corner segment cut from a CubicSurface_44}}

==Usage==

# Select in the [[3D_View|3D View]]:
## A CubicSurface_44.
## A CubicCurve_4 that matches part of an edge of that surface.
## Another CubicCurve_4 that matches part of an adjacent edge of that surface.
##: (the two partial curves cannot be on opposite edges of the surface).
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44_2EdgeSegments.svg|16px]] ControlGrid44_2EdgeSegments}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44_2EdgeSegments.svg|16px]] ControlGrid44_2EdgeSegments}} option from the menu.
# A '''ControlGrid44_2EdgeSegments''' object, is created.

== Properties ==

